Now that the original actual question has already been answered..
You do NOT need to drop anything to sacrifice it. You can perfectly well
sacrifice from your inventory.

The reason why many people prefer to kill big monsters-to-be-sacrificed on
the altar and then sacrifice before picking them up is that many of them
are too heavy to lift, especially when you have other stuff in your
inventory. And even if you can lift them, carrying them may make you
burdened or worse. And if the altar is far away from where you kill the
beast, the corpse may become too old to sacrifice before you reach the
altar.

